The one who was traveling with you.

284
00:20:53,480 --> 00:20:56,480
The same price as Sakura, but that means...

285
00:20:56,480 --> 00:20:57,480
With memories.

286
00:20:57,480 --> 00:20:59,480
Yes, that's it exactly.

287
00:20:59,480 --> 00:21:06,480
He has forgotten his past and the names of his parents, and even that he has already paid this price.

288
00:21:06,480 --> 00:21:08,480
He has forgotten it all.

289
00:21:08,480 --> 00:21:09,480
What's your name?

290
00:21:09,480 --> 00:21:11,480
I'm Watanuki Kamihiro.

291
00:21:11,480 --> 00:21:12,480
Watanuki?

292
00:21:12,480 --> 00:21:14,480
That means April 1st, doesn't it?

293
00:21:14,480 --> 00:21:17,480
Wait, how could you possibly have known that?

294
00:21:17,480 --> 00:21:20,480
I've asked you about it before.

295
00:21:20,480 --> 00:21:23,480
Although I imagine you don't remember it.

296
00:21:23,480 --> 00:21:28,480
It was for the same wish you're making now, Shaoram.

297
00:21:28,480 --> 00:21:31,480
You're seeking Fei Wang Reed.

298
00:21:31,480 --> 00:21:32,480
He's in Cloud Country.

299
00:21:32,480 --> 00:21:37,480
In a time that's detached from reality.

300
00:21:37,480 --> 00:21:47,480
I have obtained this body and the dimensions engraved upon it by reading time and places, as well as manipulating the lives of others.

301
00:21:47,480 --> 00:21:55,480
At last, it's finally in my power. Without it, all my efforts would have come to naught.

302
00:21:55,480 --> 00:21:58,480
So then where is the original Sakura's body?

303
00:21:58,480 --> 00:22:03,480
After I created this clone body, the other died.

304
00:22:03,480 --> 00:22:10,480
Of course I had foreseen that eventuality. All I need is the body I have right here.

305
00:22:10,480 --> 00:22:20,480
Along with the princess's soul, I'll have the power to transcend space and time and grant my wish.

306
00:22:24,480 --> 00:22:27,480
Your older brother seems to be quite busy.

307
00:22:27,480 --> 00:22:32,480
Even after your kind invitation, he insisted he needed to get to the next world.

308
00:22:32,480 --> 00:22:36,480
The others, though, they're the ones who should really be in a hurry.

309
00:22:36,480 --> 00:22:40,480
Your brother appeared to have a wish of his own, as well.

310
00:22:40,480 --> 00:22:45,480
Yes. And he will sacrifice anything to make it come true.

311
00:22:47,480 --> 00:22:50,480
All happiness and unhappiness is very much alike.

312
00:22:50,480 --> 00:22:52,480
They are both rooted in our desires.

313
00:22:52,480 --> 00:22:56,480
Which is why people will forever continue to wish.

314
00:22:56,480 --> 00:22:59,480
I hope Mokono will be able to get a little sleep tonight.

315
00:23:02,480 --> 00:23:03,480
Sakura...

316
00:23:06,480 --> 00:23:34,480
Come in.

317
00:23:34,480 --> 00:23:39,480
I didn't even knock and you already knew I was there.

318
00:23:39,480 --> 00:23:41,480
You always have.

319
00:23:41,480 --> 00:23:44,480
No matter where I hit trying to surprise you.

320
00:23:44,480 --> 00:23:48,480
You would always find me right away, Kurogane. Always.

321
00:23:48,480 --> 00:23:51,480
It's a small part of what it means to be a warrior.

322
00:23:51,480 --> 00:23:55,480
No matter where someone is hiding, I can find them.

323
00:23:55,480 --> 00:23:57,480
Especially if it's you.

324
00:23:57,480 --> 00:23:58,480
This is Ginryo.

325
00:23:58,480 --> 00:24:07,480
I'm sorry, Kurogane. I've had it with me all this time. I chose to hold onto it instead of bearing it with your mother.

326
00:24:07,480 --> 00:24:17,480
I had to, though, for that was her last wish. She called me to Sua. I spoke with her before she died.

327
00:24:17,480 --> 00:24:30,480
Tsumoyo.

328
00:24:30,480 --> 00:24:31,480
Yes?

329
00:24:31,480 --> 00:24:40,480
Once again, I'm going to be leaving Japan for a time. But I will return shortly without fail. So I swear to you again.

330
00:24:40,480 --> 00:24:59,480
All that I am is for my master. And all that I am belongs only to her. I swear this is the greatest truth I've known in my life. I swear on my true name known only to my master.

331
00:24:59,480 --> 00:25:07,480
Then good hunting, dear Yuo.

332
00:25:07,480 --> 00:25:21,480
I hope I'm not disturbing you.

333
00:25:21,480 --> 00:25:34,480
I want to thank you. For Sakura. For staying by her side this whole time. I only wish I could have done more.

334
00:25:34,480 --> 00:25:45,480
You were there for her, and that's what matters most. We should look for her. She's out there.

335
00:25:45,480 --> 00:25:52,480
Yes.

336
00:25:52,480 --> 00:26:08,480
Kurogane and Sai are in their original clothes.

337
00:26:08,480 --> 00:26:27,480
And those clothes? I've been saving them for Shara.

338
00:26:30,480 --> 00:26:32,480
Mokona? Yes, Yuko?

339
00:26:32,480 --> 00:26:36,480
You will have only one chance to get into Cloud Country.

340
00:26:36,480 --> 00:26:45,480
Watanuki gave up his memories to find Beowong Reed's location and give you this opportunity. So do everything that you can.

341
00:26:59,480 --> 00:27:00,480
Thank you.

342
00:27:00,480 --> 00:27:05,480
We know how you treasure the princess. We wish you good luck in bringing her back.

343
00:27:09,480 --> 00:27:12,480
Let's go. To Cloud Country.

344
00:27:12,480 --> 00:27:14,480
Welcome to Cloud Country.

345
00:27:22,480 --> 00:27:24,480
cockpiguen.

346
00:27:24,480 --> 00:27:54,460
I'll see you next time.

347
00:27:54,480 --> 00:28:24,460
I'll see you next time.

348
00:28:24,480 --> 00:28:54,460
I'll see you next time.

349
00:28:54,480 --> 00:29:24,460
I'll see you next time.

